<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3152" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκήριος</span></b>  (A), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>unharmed by the</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κῆρες</span>; generally,
			<i>unharmed</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				12.98
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				23.328
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Merc.</u>
				530
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				190
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Ap.</u>
				41
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				3.466
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυχαὶ ἀκήριοι,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀθάνατοι</span>
			, <i>free from power of the Fates</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ps.-Phoc.
				99
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>having no</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῆρ</span>, i.e. <i>with no fortune
				attached to them</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡμέραι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Op.</u>
					823
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>harmless</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάμπαν δ᾽ ἄμωμος οὔτις
				οὐδ᾽ ἀ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Semon.
				4
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				771
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
